        "TileImage": "$($repository 047bef31-022a-47c6-958b-f2a20e0a3576).Image",
        "Description": "Good Evening 47.\rICA have provided you information regarding 3 targets at large in at the Berlin rave tonight. First, Julius De Koning, Tonight&apos;s entertainment. He hides a dark past working for the underground, involved in organized crime and more. \r\rAlso 2 ICA agents on your trail. Agent Lowenthal and Agent Swan. they have been deployed by one of our contractors after being bribed by De Koning, to ensure his safety. Sad to say. He knows you are coming. I suggest you get a little creative, 47.",
